        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection 5057 Knob With 5002 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe perfect knobset for traditional homes, Baldwin's 5057 knob with 5002 rose is full of old world appeal. This beautiful and charming solid brass knob can be the finishing touch that changes a house into a cozy and relaxing home. It will fit 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5057 Oval Knob With 5002 Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Traditional Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 1.75\" - will not cover standard 2-1/8\" bore</li>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 2.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.437\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.125\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: choose either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Oval Knobset, Baldwin 5057",
                "description": "Baldwin Estates Collection 5057 Knob with 5002 Rose - The perfect knobset for traditional homes, Baldwin's 5057 knob with 5002 rose is full of old world appeal. This beautiful and charming solid brass knob can be the finishing touch that changes a house into a cozy and relaxing home. It will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch.",
